Revision history for Langertha-Holmgang

{{$NEXT}}
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Loader, Structure, Suite, Case: suite format 2 loads
    unchanged into objects that keep the values as written; list, locate,
    select_suites; checksum as cai-platform's digest (ADR 0005)
  - Langertha::Holmgang::World, Template, ToolSchema: tool dispatch
    (observations, simulators, handlers), Kolon output, parameter schema
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Grader, Lint: rules at the end state with the
    statuses of ADR 0006; the self-check of every case on load, with a hook
    for the runner's mock runs
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Error and Expectation: the error class and the
    expectations the grader checks
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Target: a Langertha engine plus variant settings;
    chat_turn_f runs one turn and classifies a failed one as context_exceeded
    (signatures of OpenAI, vLLM, llama.cpp, SGLang, TGI, LiteLLM, Ollama,
    Anthropic), no_vision or error
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Evaluation: per-topic rates with case weights,
    overall as the mean of topics, length-tier curves, verdicts with
    threshold, pass^k and hard cases, comparison as text, Markdown and JSON
    (ADR 0008)
  - Initial release
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Report: write and read the JSON report (holmgang_report 1,
    ADR 0006), merge reports without double counting, map cai-platform --report
    for the acceptance comparison
  - Simulator plugin contract (Role::Simulator, Role::AnswerWorld, Simulators
    registry) and the linux device simulator with the bash grammar, nftables
    evaluation and systemd calendar
  - Linux simulator: Prometheus/Alertmanager with promtool and amtool, sshd
    configuration and reload/restart, logrotate, accounts and sudo
    (Sim::Linux::Monitoring, ::Sshd, ::Logrotate, ::Accounts)
  - Simulators for device types routeros (RouterOS console: menus,
    print/add/set/remove/move, find, export, ping) and ios (Cisco IOS switch
    CLI: show, configure terminal, interfaces, VLANs)
  - Sim::Linux::Kubernetes: kubectl against a simulated cluster — stored
    resources, derived pods and status, endpoints, reachability, Ingress,
    cert-manager, RBAC
  - Sim::Linux parts Backup (tar, gzip, sha256sum, rsync, restic, cp
    attributes), Storage (mount, LVM, mkfs, resize, swap, partitions, mdadm),
    Dns (BIND: rndc, named-check*, dig, host) and Postfix (postconf, postmap,
    queue)
  - Linux simulator parts PostgreSQL (psql), MariaDB (mysql/mariadb/mysqladmin),
    Redis (redis-cli, CONFIG, INFO, BGSAVE) and RedisService (Redis from the
    service alone)
  - Sim::Linux parts Http (curl, applications, probes), Nginx (nginx -t,
    loading, serving), Pki (openssl, update-ca-certificates, client
    verification) and SshAccess (SSH login check behind the login rule)
  - Linux simulator parts Docker (Engine 26 with Compose v2), Git (working
    copy, index, push to a Forgejo server with hooks) and Helm 3 (releases,
    values, revisions against the Kubernetes part)
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Sim::Kueche: the answer world kueche (recipes,
    pantry, shopping list, week plan, unit table); reading tools no longer
    create empty entries in the state
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Haystack: generate long, deterministic contents
    (logs, configs, manifests, runbooks) from a spec, byte-identical to
    cai-platform; estimate_tokens
